# PENDING THE OWNER: authors, DOI (add "doi:" and an "identifiers" entry once deposited), and
# "repository-code:" if the generator's source is published later (it is not published at this time).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "HVAC field-service planning days"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: ODbL-1.0
abstract: >-
  Synthetic one-day planning problems of an HVAC field-service company in
  Budapest and Pécs (Hungary): technicians and two-person teams with shifts,
  breaks and skills, a queue of jobs far larger than a day's capacity with
  time windows and priorities, and OpenStreetMap road travel
  matrices; a lexicographic objective, upper bounds, best known solutions,
  a validator and a scorer.
authors:
  - name: "PENDING: creator to be named by the owner"
keywords:
  - vehicle routing
  - field service
  - team orienteering
  - time windows
  - skills
  - synthetic data
  - benchmark
  - OpenStreetMap
